      "body": {
        "en": "A flat, *mieszkanie*, has rooms: *pokój* (a room), *kuchnia*, *łazienka*, *sypialnia* (a bedroom), *salon* (a living room) and *przedpokój* (the hall by the front door). Asked *gdzie?* (where?), the room changes its ending after *w* (in): *w kuchni*, *w salonie*, *w pokoju*. A balcony takes *na*: *na balkonie*."
